<title>USA: Onalaska, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</title>
<headline>Onalaska, Wis., won by Robert W. Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W. Baird said it won $1.845 million of Onalaska, Wis., various general obligation bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.41 percent.</p>
</text>
